@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 0. 로그인 (먼저 실행)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@shoplab.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 1. 상품 id·재고 확인
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?size=20

### 2. 주문 생성 (상품 2종) → 201, PENDING_PAYMENT
# @name order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 10, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "recipient": "홍길동",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678",
  "zipcode": "06236",
  "address1": "서울시 강남구 테헤란로 123",
  "address2": "4층"
}

### 3. 상품 재고 확인 → 2번에서 주문한 만큼 줄어 있어야 함
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 4. 내 주문 목록 → "OOO 외 1건"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 주문 상세 (2번 응답의 주문번호 자동 사용)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{order.response.body.$.data.orderNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 주문 취소 → CANCELED, 재고 복구
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{order.response.body.$.data.orderNumber}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 다시 취소 → 409 ORDER_ALREADY_CANCELED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{order.response.body.$.data.orderNumber}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 재고 초과 (게이밍 노트북 16, 재고 5) → 400 OUT_OF_STOCK
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": 9, "quantity": 6 }],
  "recipient": "홍길동", "phone": "010-1234-5678", "zipcode": "06236", "address1": "서울시"
}

### 9. 품절 상품(다크 초콜릿) → 400 PRODUCT_NOT_ON_SALE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": 16, "quantity": 1 }],
  "recipient": "홍길동", "phone": "010-1234-5678", "zipcode": "06236", "address1": "서울시"
}

### 10. 수량 0, 우편번호 형식 오류 → 400 INVALID_INPUT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 0 }],
  "recipient": "홍길동", "phone": "010-1234-5678", "zipcode": "123", "address1": "서울시"
}

### 11. 없는 주문 → 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/20260101-AAAAAAAA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}